    "summary": "Woman&#039;s cap, made of pale cream coloured silk, embroidered  in silk of the same colour with leaves, berries and tendrils executed in chain stitch and knots; lined in printed cotton with a striped pattern of pink flower sprays and brown ikat-like motifs on a cream ground, the interior stiffened. In  the form of a close-fitting skull-cap, the front curved to a point at the centre,  with a drawstring at the base to tighten the cap and a ribbon bow in floral silk attached to the back with the original round-headed metal pins.",
